  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A tameable pet. base animal is needed for taming and breeding. msm:tameable tames it one time in three when a player feeds it sweet or glow berries; once tamed it follows its owner (follow sets its speed and distances), sits or stands when the owner right-clicks it with an empty hand, attacks what hurts its owner or what its owner attacks, never despawns and has 20 health. msm:breedable makes two foxes fed cooked chicken or rabbit have a half-size baby; taming and breeding foods differ, so feeding one never does the other. msm:variants with choose biome gives foxes that spawn in #minecraft:spawns_snow_foxes the snow coat and every other fox the default one; babies take a parent's coat.",
